  "_approach": "The Afterlife-era default: restrained 4/4 kick, tight clap on 2 and 4, open hat on every offbeat 8th, constant 16th closed hats with the offbeat emphasised (EDMProd's 'signature' melodic techno hat) and a rolling 16th shaker with a 4-step velocity contour. Bar 2 adds a clap ghost and a rim skip. Reference: Tale Of Us 'Monument', Anyma & Chris Avantgarde 'Eternity'. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
